PLTA-23-2

October 16, 2023

Attachment 1
Details on the public outreach accomplished prior to the Planning Commission mailing

Staff conducted public outreach on the afternoon of October 5th by going to a local retail establishment
and interacting with those at the premises (with the full knowledge and permission of the retail
establishment). Staff engaged via discussion and survey (the survey is found on the next page). The
interaction included a large board with large pictures of current apartment buildings in Cheyenne, each
with a letter. The survey included smaller pictures of the same and asked each participant to rate each
building as ‘preferred’, ‘acceptable’, or ‘not acceptable’.

